📊 Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard (Excel Project)

🔍 Project Overview

This project analyzes a sales dataset containing **revenue, manager, region, and category data**. The goal was to convert raw, unclean data into a **structured format and build an interactive dashboard** for business insights.



🎯 Objectives

* Clean and preprocess raw sales data
* Analyze revenue and performance metrics
* Generate manager-wise and region-wise insights
* Build a professional Excel dashboard



📂 Dataset Features

* Sales Records
* Revenue Data
* Manager Names
* Product Categories
* Regional Information



🛠️ Tools & Techniques Used

* Microsoft Excel
* Data Cleaning (TRIM, CLEAN)
* Data Transformation
* SUMIFS for conditional calculations
* Pivot Tables & Pivot Charts
* Dashboard Design


 🔄 Project Workflow

 1. Data Cleaning

* Removed extra spaces and hidden characters
* Fixed inconsistent manager names
* Standardized text and formatting

 2. Data Processing

* Created a **Manager Updated column**
* Structured dataset for accurate analysis
* Applied formulas like SUMIFS for revenue calculation

3. Data Analysis

* Built Pivot Tables to analyze:

  * Revenue by Manager
  * Sales by Region
  * Category-wise performance

 4. Dashboard Creation

* Designed a clean and interactive dashboard
* Added charts and filters for better usability
* Focused on business-friendly visualization


📈 Key Insights

* Identified top-performing managers
* Compared revenue across regions
* Highlighted category-wise trends
* Improved data reliability through cleaning



🚀 Learning Outcomes

* Real-world data cleaning techniques
* Advanced Excel formula usage
* Practical dashboard building
* Turning raw data into actionable insights


